{"ID":"20240205153910-n5wrf8b","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153910-n5wrf8b","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153910-n5wrf8b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101830-50fm5bd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205155134-epuqjpt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101830-50fm5bd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:157,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:157\u0026#125;","title":"牛蒡子（大力子、恶食）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902102732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206101830-50fm5bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101830-50fm5bd","updated":"20240206101839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河北，吉林、辽宁、浙江、黑龙江等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈长倒卵形，略扁，微弯曲，长57mm，宽23mm。表面灰褐色，带紫黑色斑点，有数条纵棱，通常中间1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2条较明显。顶端钝圆，稍宽，顶面有圆环，中间具点状花柱残迹；基部略窄，着生面色较淡。果皮较硬，子叶2，淡黄白色，富油性。无臭，味苦后微辛而稍麻舌。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，寒。\n【功效】\t疏散风热，宣肺透疹，解毒利咽。用于风热感冒，咳嗽痰多，麻疹，风疹，咽喉肿痛，痄腮丹毒，痈肿疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240206101831-svvl8i3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101831-svvl8i3","updated":"20240206101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206101831-itfn8c3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155134-epuqjpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155134-epuqjpt","updated":"20240205155134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛蒡子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛蒡子-20240205155134-d273dbn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717094427-orptbxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717094427-orptbxh","updated":"20240717094427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛蒡子 (18)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛蒡子 18-20240717094427-42d8hv2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716175228-l961f7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716175228-l961f7u","updated":"20240716175228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 653px;","style":"width: 643px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛蒡子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛蒡子 1-20240716175228-5xat9mt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 643px;\" parent-style=\"width: 653px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 609px;","style":"width: 599px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛蒡子 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛蒡子 2-20240716175439-kcobe36.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 599px;\" parent-style=\"width: 609px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716175556-ryl7o1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716175556-ryl7o1e","updated":"20240717080129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 828px;